// TRANSLATORS: Extension name shown by extension managers.
_('Lintel');

// TRANSLATORS: Extension description shown by extension managers.
_('Reworks the GNOME top bar into a macOS-Tahoe-style menu bar with a free-floating Notification Center while keeping the native GNOME Panel, notification model, accessibility and third-party status items intact. Non-destructive: disabling restores the stock top bar without a logout.');
